WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.785 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:49.785 --> 01:51.025
Help!

5
01:51.625 --> 01:53.145
Help!

6
01:54.545 --> 01:56.425
Somebody!

7
01:56.505 --> 01:58.345
Is anyone there? Help!

8
02:02.465 --> 02:04.265
-Put out the fire! -Help!

9
02:04.345 --> 02:05.945
-Hurry! -Help!

10
02:06.025 --> 02:07.465
-Put out the fire! -Help!

11
02:07.545 --> 02:08.385
Hurry!

12
02:10.225 --> 02:12.385
Hurry! Hurry!

13
02:12.465 --> 02:13.225
BOOK PAVILION

14
02:13.305 --> 02:14.785
Put out the fire!

15
02:14.865 --> 02:16.025
Hurry!

16
02:16.105 --> 02:17.265
-Hurry! -Come on!

17
02:17.345 --> 02:18.265
Hurry!

18
02:18.785 --> 02:20.425
Over here! Hurry!

19
02:20.505 --> 02:21.665
-Grandmother. -This…

20
02:21.745 --> 02:23.905
If you still see me as your grandmother,

21
02:23.985 --> 02:25.025
-then shut your mouth right now. -Over here!

22
02:25.105 --> 02:25.985
Hurry up!

23
02:26.065 --> 02:27.945
Hurry! Break that lock!

24
02:28.545 --> 02:29.905
-Get her out! -Quick!

25
02:38.865 --> 02:39.945
This way!

26
02:40.025 --> 02:40.865
Hurry!

27
02:43.305 --> 02:44.945
Hurry!

28
02:45.665 --> 02:47.505
Why are there two Lady Raos?

29
02:49.225 --> 02:50.185
You may all leave.

30
03:00.265 --> 03:01.905
I was just about to tell you, Grandmother.

31
03:02.665 --> 03:04.505
I was foolish and stubborn.

32
03:04.585 --> 03:06.145
I tried to take my own life before the wedding.

33
03:06.745 --> 03:08.265
Aunt Heng'e felt sorry for me.

34
03:08.345 --> 03:09.825
She feared forcing me to marry into the Lu family

35
03:09.905 --> 03:11.385
would only lead to disaster.

36
03:11.465 --> 03:14.225
So she went to great lengths to find this woman to take my place.

37
03:14.305 --> 03:16.105
It was only meant to be temporary.

38
03:16.185 --> 03:18.985
But Aunt Heng'e kept trying to persuade me and made me see what was at stake.

39
03:19.065 --> 03:20.665
Only then did I realize my terrible mistake.

40
03:20.745 --> 03:22.185
I deeply regretted it.

41
03:22.265 --> 03:24.025
I'd long wanted to go to the Duke's Residence and beg forgiveness.

42
03:27.265 --> 03:29.185
Mother, don't blame her.

43
03:29.265 --> 03:30.905
It was me. I didn't let her go.

44
03:31.585 --> 03:33.145
Lord Lu was still ill,

45
03:33.225 --> 03:34.905
and the Lu family was in turmoil.

46
03:34.985 --> 03:36.465
If they learned the truth,

47
03:37.065 --> 03:39.745
instead of bringing Lord Lu luck, it might cost his life.

48
03:39.825 --> 03:41.825
That would've been a grave sin, Mother.

49
03:42.425 --> 03:44.065
When we heard Lord Lu had recovered,

50
03:44.865 --> 03:46.625
I was overjoyed.

51
03:46.705 --> 03:50.025
I planned to secretly switch back during this visit.

52
03:50.105 --> 03:53.545
But this woman wanted the wealth and status of the Lu family.

53
03:53.625 --> 03:55.665
She threatened to tell everyone the whole truth.

54
03:55.745 --> 03:58.585
I had no choice but to lock her up.

55
03:58.665 --> 04:01.625
Humiliated and furious, she started hurling vile accusations,

56
04:01.705 --> 04:03.625
threatening to ruin the Wei family's name!

57
04:05.345 --> 04:07.265
I panicked, so I…

58
04:07.985 --> 04:11.785
Grandmother, I was wrong. I was wrong.

59
04:11.865 --> 04:13.225
Every word is a lie!

60
04:14.145 --> 04:17.665
An orphan girl has no right to threaten a noble lady.

61
04:17.745 --> 04:20.225
You were clearly trying to burn me alive!

62
04:35.945 --> 04:36.985
Mother.

63
04:40.065 --> 04:43.425
A life was at stake. How could you dare?

64
04:46.425 --> 04:47.305
You knew about this too?

65
04:48.985 --> 04:51.065
I was too timid to tell you.

66
04:52.185 --> 04:54.825
Fine.

67
04:54.905 --> 04:56.985
So you all pulled off this whole deception,

68
04:57.985 --> 05:00.505
and I was the only one kept in the dark.

69
05:01.105 --> 05:04.665
Do you have any respect for me at all?

70
05:06.265 --> 05:08.345
Mother, we're family.

71
05:08.425 --> 05:11.425
No matter how badly we've erred, we share one fate.

72
05:11.505 --> 05:12.425
If one falls, we all suffer.

73
05:13.025 --> 05:15.745
Lord Lu is here right now.

74
05:16.345 --> 05:17.865
If he hears even a word of this,

75
05:17.945 --> 05:20.225
there'll be serious trouble.

76
05:20.305 --> 05:21.545
For the Wei family's century-old good name,

77
05:21.625 --> 05:24.105
this must not get out.

78
05:33.025 --> 05:35.305
Yes. The Wei family's good name comes first.

79
05:35.385 --> 05:38.865
Mother can punish me however you want later.

80
05:38.945 --> 05:40.665
But this woman cannot live.

81
05:40.745 --> 05:42.705
Keeping her alive will only bring disaster.

82
05:44.745 --> 05:47.065
Mother, you're too merciful to do it.

83
05:47.585 --> 05:50.185
Then let me do it for you.

84
05:50.905 --> 05:52.705
Grandmother! Please!

85
05:52.785 --> 05:54.585
Save me! Please!

86
06:09.745 --> 06:10.905
Drag her out, now!

87
06:22.585 --> 06:23.425
My Lord!

88
06:24.065 --> 06:24.945
My Lord!

89
06:25.025 --> 06:26.865
Why the panic? Where is Rao?

90
06:29.785 --> 06:32.185
My Lady suddenly felt dizzy in the garden.

91
06:32.705 --> 06:35.385
I couldn't support her by myself, so I hurried back for help.

92
06:39.905 --> 06:41.025
Dowager Lady!

93
06:43.825 --> 06:44.905
Dowager Lady.

94
06:45.905 --> 06:48.945
I'm just a helpless orphan with no family, power, or status.

95
06:49.025 --> 06:52.105
The Wei family paid me 50,000 coins to marry Lord Lu for luck,

96
06:52.185 --> 06:54.665
and spend my life widowed in Lady Rao's place.

97
06:55.665 --> 06:58.385
We agreed that from then on, fate would decide my life,

98
06:58.465 --> 07:00.545
and the Wei family would stay out of it.

99
07:00.625 --> 07:03.545
But Lord Lu survived.

100
07:03.625 --> 07:05.745
So they changed their minds.

101
07:06.345 --> 07:08.905
They tricked me here and tried to kill me to keep me quiet.

102
07:09.905 --> 07:12.665
Dowager Lady, Lady Rao and I may share a face,

103
07:13.265 --> 07:14.745
but we're nothing alike in personalities or bearing.

104
07:14.825 --> 07:15.785
BOOK PAVILION

105
07:15.865 --> 07:17.625
Lord Lu is far too perceptive.

106
07:18.225 --> 07:19.345
He and I became a couple.

107
07:19.945 --> 07:21.865
We've spent every day and night together.

108
07:21.945 --> 07:23.385
How could he not know the difference?

109
07:24.065 --> 07:26.145
You… You've already shared his bed?

110
07:26.865 --> 07:28.145
That's impossible!

111
07:28.225 --> 07:29.465
Lu Zhuo only just recovered from a grave illness.

112
07:29.545 --> 07:32.105
No matter how anxious the Duchess may be,

113
07:32.185 --> 07:34.625
would she really let her grandson be intimate with a woman so soon?

114
07:35.225 --> 07:38.585
To save herself, she'd tell any outrageous lie!

115
07:38.665 --> 07:40.785
Don't believe her. Don't!

116
07:42.545 --> 07:44.105
Newlyweds are always inseparable.

117
07:44.185 --> 07:46.265
We'll be living closely as husband and wife.

118
07:47.185 --> 07:49.025
How many moles I have on my body…

119
07:49.545 --> 07:51.425
How could my own husband not know?

120
07:53.905 --> 07:54.905
Shameless!

121
07:56.865 --> 08:00.705
Grandmother, she became Lady Wei Rao and Lord Lu's wife.

122
08:00.785 --> 08:03.345
Then what about me? Who am I supposed to be?

123
08:04.665 --> 08:07.705
I won't even be able to show my face in public again.

124
08:08.905 --> 08:11.425
You've always loved me most.

125
08:11.505 --> 08:14.945
Can you really bear to see me ruined for life, Grandmother?

126
08:16.145 --> 08:19.145
I was wrong. I know I was wrong. I don't want her dead anymore.

127
08:19.745 --> 08:22.225
I only want to take back my rightful place.

128
08:22.305 --> 08:25.465
If Lu Zhuo really finds out, I'll go confess myself.

129
08:26.065 --> 08:27.625
I'll kneel and beg the Lu family.

130
08:27.705 --> 08:29.905
They're a noble and distinguished family.

131
08:29.985 --> 08:33.465
Would they really rather have a woman who emptied chamber pots than me?

132
08:34.745 --> 08:36.985
She gave up more than just her husband.

133
08:37.825 --> 08:41.024
She even gave away the name her own father gave her.

134
08:41.105 --> 08:44.264
How is Rao supposed to live, Mother?

135
08:45.825 --> 08:48.425
Mother, you've always treasured Rao above all else.

136
08:48.505 --> 08:50.665
You've cherished her for 18 years.

137
08:51.385 --> 08:54.785
Can you really bear to make her hide for the rest of her life,

138
08:54.865 --> 08:57.105
never able to show her face again?

139
09:15.625 --> 09:18.225
You showed no fear when plotting this.

140
09:19.225 --> 09:22.425
And when you tried to silence me, you didn't hesitate for a second.

141
09:23.305 --> 09:24.705
From beginning to end,

142
09:24.785 --> 09:26.785
you showed the Dowager Lady no respect at all.

143
09:27.665 --> 09:29.225
Dowager Lady, you know right from wrong.

144
09:29.305 --> 09:31.425
You can clearly see who's right and who's wrong.

145
09:31.505 --> 09:37.145
I'm only an orphan asking you to do what's best and give me justice.

146
09:42.545 --> 09:45.345
You… All of you… This…

147
09:45.425 --> 09:47.985
Dowager Lady! Dowager Lady!

148
09:48.505 --> 09:51.745
For some reason, Lord Lu is heading straight for the back garden.

149
09:52.945 --> 09:55.945
Grandmother, please grant Rao this one wish.

150
09:56.025 --> 09:58.745
From now on, I'll obey your every word and never defy you again.

151
09:58.825 --> 10:00.425
I'll devote myself to my husband

152
10:00.505 --> 10:01.945
and be a worthy principal wife of the Duke's Residence.

153
10:02.545 --> 10:04.745
I'll never make you worry or feel disappointed again.

154
10:05.345 --> 10:08.465
Mother, my brother is watching from heaven.

155
10:09.065 --> 10:13.785
He's watching how the Wei family treats his own daughter.

156
10:14.865 --> 10:17.105
Have you forgotten the vow you made?

157
10:17.185 --> 10:19.825
You swore to protect, cherish, and dote on her,

158
10:19.905 --> 10:23.225
and never let her suffer the slightest wrong. Mother…

159
10:33.145 --> 10:35.385
Mother, decide quickly.

160
10:35.465 --> 10:37.105
We can't delay any longer.

161
10:47.425 --> 10:48.705
Take her away.

162
11:02.705 --> 11:05.385
My Lord, all the guests came to see you.

163
11:05.465 --> 11:06.345
The others are manageable,

164
11:06.425 --> 11:08.385
but those nobles are proving quite difficult.

165
11:08.465 --> 11:09.545
Please join us in the reception pavilion

166
11:09.625 --> 11:11.785
-and spare His Lordship the trouble. -I can't go right now.

167
11:11.865 --> 11:12.905
Give my apologies to your lord.

168
11:12.985 --> 11:15.545
If you don't come, I won't know what to tell His Lordship.

169
11:17.065 --> 11:18.585
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

170
11:18.665 --> 11:19.665
My Lord!

171
11:19.745 --> 11:21.745
He seems to be heading toward the Book Pavilion.

172
11:36.545 --> 11:37.625
What's wrong?

173
11:37.705 --> 11:39.385
I felt very dizzy just now.

174
11:40.505 --> 11:42.145
I went to rest against a tree

175
11:42.225 --> 11:44.585
and came across a little green snake.

176
11:45.105 --> 11:46.145
I'm fine now.

177
11:48.025 --> 11:49.785
-I'll take you to Begonia Court. -No.

178
11:53.025 --> 11:54.105
I'm not going.

179
11:54.825 --> 11:56.265
Grandmother cares for me most.

180
11:56.785 --> 11:57.905
I don't want to frighten her.

181
12:00.905 --> 12:02.185
I'll head back first.

182
12:04.545 --> 12:06.265
Bitao, come help me.

183
12:17.145 --> 12:18.185
My Lord.

184
12:20.985 --> 12:22.105
Tell Old Madam Wei

185
12:22.625 --> 12:25.185
I'm feeling unwell and have returned to the Duke's Residence to rest.

186
12:25.265 --> 12:27.225
-I'll visit again another day. -Yes.

187
12:30.985 --> 12:32.025
Let's go.

188
12:35.745 --> 12:36.905
Let go of me!

189
12:37.465 --> 12:38.745
Let me go!

190
12:39.425 --> 12:40.465
-Let go! -Lady Rao!

191
12:40.545 --> 12:41.385
Lady Rao, calm down!

192
12:41.465 --> 12:43.225
-Let me go! -Lady Rao.

193
12:45.145 --> 12:46.305
Let go!

194
12:48.985 --> 12:50.465
-You may all leave. -Rao.

195
12:52.705 --> 12:54.265
Quick, come untie her.

196
12:58.705 --> 13:00.105
-Rao. -You're not my grandmother!

197
13:00.185 --> 13:01.345
What are you doing?

198
13:01.425 --> 13:02.265
-All these years, -Rao!

199
13:02.345 --> 13:04.665
you kept saying you loved me most!

200
13:04.745 --> 13:06.705
-Lies! All lies! -Rao!

201
13:06.785 --> 13:08.865
-Calm down! -If you truly loved me,

202
13:08.945 --> 13:11.105
you wouldn't let some impostor take my place,

203
13:11.185 --> 13:13.305
then turn around and tie up your own granddaughter!

204
13:13.385 --> 13:15.665
-Rao. -How can you be so heartless?

205
13:18.865 --> 13:19.785
Take her away.

206
13:23.585 --> 13:24.825
Stop.

207
13:29.225 --> 13:30.545
What's done can't be undone.

208
13:31.585 --> 13:32.745
This is fate.

209
13:33.585 --> 13:36.945
Whoever went through the wedding that day

210
13:37.985 --> 13:42.265
is the daughter married out of the Wei Residence

211
13:43.025 --> 13:45.345
and my own granddaughter.

212
13:46.665 --> 13:49.225
If anyone else dares say otherwise,

213
13:50.745 --> 13:52.785
they'll be cast out of the Wei family!

214
13:52.865 --> 13:54.545
-Mother! -Grandmother!

215
13:55.065 --> 13:56.785
-Grandmother! -Mother!

216
13:59.945 --> 14:02.025
Wei Rao, clean yourself up.

217
14:02.985 --> 14:04.705
Go see your husband.

218
14:12.185 --> 14:13.585
Dowager Lady, I'll never forget

219
14:17.505 --> 14:18.865
your great kindness.

220
14:26.745 --> 14:27.825
Please return the golden hairpin.

221
14:41.345 --> 14:42.465
Rao.

222
14:42.545 --> 14:45.025
How can you speak to Grandmother like that?

223
14:45.665 --> 14:47.345
Am I wrong?

224
14:49.665 --> 14:51.145
All these years,

225
14:52.105 --> 14:54.265
you kept me locked up like a prisoner

226
14:54.345 --> 14:56.305
just because you hated my mother.

227
14:56.825 --> 14:59.105
You hated that she remarried right after Father died.

228
14:59.185 --> 15:00.705
Because of you,

229
15:01.225 --> 15:04.625
I couldn't see Mother growing up or have anything to do with her family.

230
15:04.705 --> 15:06.945
Your precious treasure?

231
15:07.025 --> 15:09.905
I was nothing but a little dog you kept.

232
15:13.025 --> 15:14.745
You must hate me, don't you?

233
15:15.505 --> 15:17.945
Even looking at me must hurt, right?

234
15:18.585 --> 15:21.505
Yet you still had to raise me and treat me well.

235
15:21.585 --> 15:23.905
Otherwise, you'd have failed your son who died so young!

236
15:24.545 --> 15:25.825
Rao, that's enough!

237
15:25.905 --> 15:27.825
You're afraid people will call you heartless.

238
15:27.905 --> 15:28.745
Rao!

239
15:29.665 --> 15:31.185
You're afraid they'll condemn you behind your back.

240
15:31.265 --> 15:33.465
It's all an act. You're a hypocrite!

241
15:33.545 --> 15:34.585
Stop it!

242
15:35.505 --> 15:36.705
Mother!

243
15:38.905 --> 15:40.185
Please, stop.

244
15:40.265 --> 15:41.705
Rao, are you all right?

245
15:45.825 --> 15:46.785
Stop it.

246
15:50.785 --> 15:53.305
I struck a nerve, didn't I?

247
15:54.665 --> 15:57.865
You sided with an outsider against your own granddaughter.

248
15:58.465 --> 16:01.385
Father won't rest in peace after seeing this.

249
16:02.625 --> 16:04.185
I curse you.

250
16:04.745 --> 16:06.025
-I hate you! -Rao!

251
16:06.705 --> 16:08.225
Will you please stop?

252
16:08.305 --> 16:09.265
Enough!

253
16:09.345 --> 16:11.505
Stop breaking your grandmother's heart!

254
16:15.025 --> 16:15.945
Mother.

255
16:16.625 --> 16:18.545
Please don't blame her for feeling betrayed.

256
16:18.625 --> 16:20.545
But I don't understand either.

257
16:21.425 --> 16:23.505
Why would you do this?

258
16:24.745 --> 16:27.025
I spoiled you too much.

259
16:27.865 --> 16:31.025
I indulged you until you forgot your place.

260
16:31.105 --> 16:33.865
You keep calling her a chamber-pot woman,

261
16:33.945 --> 16:35.425
but the truth is…

262
16:35.945 --> 16:38.905
You're nowhere near as clever as she is.

263
16:40.705 --> 16:44.705
Do you know what she told me in this room?

264
16:46.065 --> 16:50.265
Rao, get up. Please, get up. The floor is cold.

265
17:12.665 --> 17:13.505
You…

266
17:14.785 --> 17:15.665
You…

267
17:16.704 --> 17:18.905
I'm not really Lady Wei Rao.

268
17:19.424 --> 17:20.704
My name is A-Chou.

269
17:21.785 --> 17:24.704
I'm just a servant who empties chamber pots on the streets.

270
17:24.785 --> 17:28.665
They found me to marry into the Lu family in Lady Rao's place.

271
17:30.105 --> 17:31.105
What…

272
17:32.705 --> 17:35.225
A… A substitute bride?

273
17:35.865 --> 17:39.305
How could they do something so reckless?

274
17:40.385 --> 17:43.105
Absurd. Absolutely absurd…

275
17:43.185 --> 17:45.265
Dowager Lady, please don't upset yourself.

276
17:45.345 --> 17:46.905
I come from a humble background.

277
17:46.985 --> 17:48.505
I'm no one of importance.

278
17:48.585 --> 17:51.865
But even the lowliest creature clings to life. I only want to live.

279
17:54.465 --> 17:55.425
Dowager Lady.

280
17:58.825 --> 18:02.065
The marriage between our families was arranged by the Empress Dowager.

281
18:03.145 --> 18:04.745
If this secret gets out,

282
18:05.265 --> 18:06.505
the Duke of Ying and Earl of Cheng'an's families

283
18:06.585 --> 18:07.865
will become bitter enemies.

284
18:08.505 --> 18:10.025
The Wei family will be guilty of deceiving His Majesty.

285
18:10.105 --> 18:11.545
It's a crime that can never be pardoned.

286
18:12.225 --> 18:13.825
If we don't want the whole family executed,

287
18:14.745 --> 18:17.265
this secret must stay buried.

288
18:17.785 --> 18:19.025
Not a word can get out.

289
18:21.785 --> 18:26.665
So I dared to secure myself some protection.

290
18:27.985 --> 18:29.625
Protection?

291
18:30.545 --> 18:34.385
I hid a silk handkerchief among Lord Lu's belongings.

292
18:35.865 --> 18:39.345
It explains in detail how I became the substitute bride.

293
18:40.665 --> 18:44.625
If she dies in the Wei Residence today,

294
18:44.705 --> 18:48.185
the Duke's Residence will send men tomorrow to demand answers.

295
18:48.265 --> 18:50.985
Sending a lowly servant as a substitute bride

296
18:51.065 --> 18:53.705
is an insult to the Lu family

297
18:53.785 --> 18:56.705
and a grave offense against the Imperial Family!

298
18:57.425 --> 19:01.345
The entire household will die with you.

299
19:01.425 --> 19:03.785
They'll come demanding answers!

300
19:06.705 --> 19:08.465
I was wrong about her!

301
19:08.985 --> 19:12.385
That wretched woman is far more cunning than I thought!

302
19:12.465 --> 19:13.945
Enough!

303
19:14.025 --> 19:17.345
You kept indulging her reckless behavior

304
19:17.425 --> 19:20.745
and nearly got the entire family killed!

305
19:21.625 --> 19:24.625
Are you satisfied now?

306
19:27.025 --> 19:28.345
Mother.

307
19:29.265 --> 19:30.825
She won't reveal the secret, will she?

308
19:31.825 --> 19:33.825
She's a clever girl.

309
19:34.425 --> 19:36.185
And she acts decisively.

310
19:37.065 --> 19:39.025
Didn't the servants say so?

311
19:39.105 --> 19:42.985
She even managed to fool Lu Zhuo.

312
19:44.145 --> 19:46.705
As long as you don't push her too far,

313
19:47.785 --> 19:50.025
she won't risk her own life.

314
19:51.265 --> 19:53.105
Grandmother only cares about the family.

315
19:53.625 --> 19:54.825
But what about my future?

316
19:55.505 --> 20:00.265
There can only be one Lady Wei Rao,

317
20:00.345 --> 20:02.505
and she is the principal wife of the Duke's Residence.

318
20:06.545 --> 20:09.865
What you gave away with your own hands

319
20:10.465 --> 20:15.225
wasn't just your status as the Wei family's cherished daughter.

320
20:15.305 --> 20:20.945
You also gave away a powerful, high-ranking husband,

321
20:21.025 --> 20:23.505
and all the wealth and honor

322
20:23.585 --> 20:25.745
you would've enjoyed for the rest of your life!

323
20:35.185 --> 20:36.665
It's fate.

324
20:37.745 --> 20:39.865
Fate.

325
20:40.985 --> 20:45.465
I don't want to accept it, but I have no choice.

326
20:46.185 --> 20:47.705
And you…

327
20:49.465 --> 20:50.825
You…

328
20:52.865 --> 20:56.185
Mother, have mercy!

329
20:56.265 --> 20:59.185
Please leave your own granddaughter some way to live! Mother!

330
21:02.265 --> 21:05.065
We could say she came from Yizhou,

331
21:05.145 --> 21:06.865
from the Dowager Lady's maternal family.

332
21:06.945 --> 21:09.585
Since she looks so much like Lady Rao,

333
21:10.185 --> 21:12.025
she brought the Dowager Lady comfort,

334
21:12.105 --> 21:15.665
so the Dowager Lady took her as a god-granddaughter.

335
21:16.265 --> 21:17.745
As long as we keep the servants in line,

336
21:17.825 --> 21:21.145
there shouldn't be any trouble.

337
21:24.745 --> 21:28.105
I lost my head and said things that hurt you, Grandmother.

338
21:28.625 --> 21:29.665
I was wrong.

339
21:30.265 --> 21:31.745
I know I was wrong!

340
21:32.265 --> 21:34.505
I truly know I was wrong!

341
21:36.065 --> 21:39.065
Mother! Mother!

342
21:39.145 --> 21:40.305
Mother.

343
21:41.385 --> 21:44.345
Never forget the lesson you learned today.

344
21:44.425 --> 21:47.585
Stay in your room and reflect on what you've done.

345
21:47.665 --> 21:50.745
Don't cause any more trouble.

346
21:55.265 --> 21:57.025
Mother…

347
22:08.345 --> 22:11.105
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

348
22:11.185 --> 22:12.025
You may all leave.

349
22:17.985 --> 22:18.945
Why don't you burn incense anymore?

350
22:21.465 --> 22:24.985
Before you were married, you used an incense burner in your room,

351
22:25.065 --> 22:26.065
and even scented your clothes.

352
22:26.745 --> 22:29.625
I heard you even had a special incense cage made for your bedding

353
22:29.705 --> 22:32.145
and wouldn't sleep until the bedding was fully scented.

354
22:35.425 --> 22:36.785
Yet since marrying into my family,

355
22:37.825 --> 22:39.345
I haven't seen you use one even once.

356
22:40.505 --> 22:41.785
He's suspicious.

357
22:42.625 --> 22:45.865
Back home, I was very particular and never settled for less.

358
22:46.385 --> 22:48.985
But now I'm married, and you've been ill.

359
22:49.825 --> 22:52.585
How could I care about makeup, perfume, or incense?

360
22:52.665 --> 22:56.025
Besides, incense often contains medicinal herbs.

361
22:56.105 --> 22:57.785
I feared it might interfere with your medicine.

362
22:57.865 --> 22:59.705
So I stopped using it.

363
23:00.505 --> 23:01.625
Is your hand better?

364
23:03.065 --> 23:05.625
Physician Zhao worked wonders. It's much better.

365
23:07.505 --> 23:08.505
Qi Zhongkai.

366
23:13.465 --> 23:15.265
He's the second son of the Marquis of Pingxi.

367
23:16.265 --> 23:17.185
We've always been close.

368
23:17.865 --> 23:20.825
He heard I'd recovered and wants to hold a banquet for me.

369
23:20.905 --> 23:22.545
I've been feeling exhausted.

370
23:23.305 --> 23:24.945
I can't be bothered with all that ceremony.

371
23:26.865 --> 23:28.145
Write back and politely decline for me.

372
24:13.385 --> 24:14.625
What's wrong?

373
24:15.465 --> 24:19.905
I'm not sure what rank Lord Qi holds or how I should address him.

374
24:22.665 --> 24:24.225
He's General of Ningshuo.

375
24:25.225 --> 24:28.345
But when we write to each other, I address him by his courtesy name.

376
24:29.025 --> 24:29.905
Shunqin.

377
24:32.225 --> 24:33.065
Go ahead.

378
24:48.905 --> 24:49.825
My Lord.

379
24:53.505 --> 24:56.425
My Lord, the Dowager Lady heard you were back.

380
24:56.505 --> 24:57.545
She wants you to see her at once.

381
25:04.065 --> 25:05.185
No rush.

382
25:18.505 --> 25:21.025
SHUN

383
25:23.305 --> 25:24.945
Judging by her old handwriting,

384
25:25.025 --> 25:27.545
she must've been hot-tempered, narrow-minded, and impulsive.

385
25:27.625 --> 25:28.345
SHUNQIN

386
25:28.425 --> 25:31.825
Her strokes are softer now, and lack some strength.

387
25:31.905 --> 25:32.905
Similar, but not quite.

388
25:33.905 --> 25:35.585
But her right hand was injured before.

389
25:37.985 --> 25:38.825
My Lord.

390
25:39.865 --> 25:42.745
You are a noble lady who grew up in comfort.

391
25:44.425 --> 25:45.825
Why do you have calluses

392
25:47.985 --> 25:49.265
and so many scars on your hands?

393
25:52.465 --> 25:53.665
Why won't you answer me?

394
25:58.505 --> 26:01.025
What secret are you hiding from me?

395
26:06.265 --> 26:08.025
If you're still hiding anything,

396
26:10.105 --> 26:11.625
I won't forgive you.

397
26:21.505 --> 26:22.905
Why must you press me so hard?

398
26:23.425 --> 26:25.345
Don't you know my family background?

399
26:26.785 --> 26:29.265
My father's family isn't my only family.

400
26:30.625 --> 26:32.385
There's also my mother's family, scorned by society.

401
26:34.345 --> 26:37.505
My maternal grandmother is Lady Shou'an, His Majesty's former wet nurse.

402
26:37.585 --> 26:39.305
My own mother…

403
26:41.425 --> 26:42.265
She…

404
26:46.505 --> 26:48.625
Grandmother doesn't want me seeing my mother's family.

405
26:50.385 --> 26:53.385
But Lady Shou'an is my maternal grandmother.

406
26:53.465 --> 26:54.665
How could I not be close to her?

407
26:55.945 --> 26:59.985
She was born a farm girl and often grew homesick and depressed.

408
27:00.545 --> 27:03.825
His Majesty granted her an estate and farmland outside the capital.

409
27:05.065 --> 27:06.745
With my wedding approaching,

410
27:06.825 --> 27:08.505
I didn't know when I'd see her again.

411
27:09.025 --> 27:10.825
So I often visited her behind Grandmother's back.

412
27:11.585 --> 27:14.385
I helped her raise silkworms and weave cloth.

413
27:14.985 --> 27:17.265
Sometimes I'd even help with farm work.

414
27:17.865 --> 27:18.785
As for these scars…

415
27:22.825 --> 27:24.065
I was just being a busybody.

416
27:25.865 --> 27:26.705
You…

417
27:37.105 --> 27:38.825
My Lady knew you weren't sleeping well,

418
27:38.905 --> 27:41.145
so she dried the herbs herself

419
27:41.225 --> 27:43.305
and stitched this herbal pillow by hand.

420
27:43.385 --> 27:46.825
That's how My Lady's hands ended up with so many cuts.

421
27:46.905 --> 27:47.985
Stop right there.

422
27:49.345 --> 27:50.865
What else do you need, My Lord?

423
27:53.825 --> 27:55.905
Never mind. Leave it here.

424
27:57.305 --> 27:59.665
The herbs need to be dried again every three days.

425
27:59.745 --> 28:00.905
Bring it back after I've replaced them.

426
28:11.585 --> 28:12.865
Bring me a bamboo basket.

427
28:44.465 --> 28:46.745
People don't change their true nature.

428
28:46.825 --> 28:48.985
No matter how beautiful this woman is or how well she hides it,

429
28:49.945 --> 28:52.985
never forget how vicious and cruel she was when she killed.

430
28:53.745 --> 28:56.305
Don't be fooled by a beautiful monster in a pretty disguise.

431
29:01.065 --> 29:02.825
Do not disturb His Lordship while he's reading.

432
29:29.345 --> 29:32.345
Bitao, thank you for bringing Lord Lu.

433
29:32.425 --> 29:33.785
You got me out of a desperate situation.

434
29:33.865 --> 29:35.225
It was your quick thinking, My Lady,

435
29:35.305 --> 29:37.105
that got you safely out of the Wei Residence.

436
29:37.705 --> 29:40.905
You even thought of Lady Rao's old scar on her hand.

437
29:50.625 --> 29:52.305
I have something important to show you.

438
30:03.705 --> 30:04.545
This…

439
30:06.145 --> 30:08.025
This is my indenture contract.

440
30:08.105 --> 30:08.945
BITAO'S INDENTURE CONTRACT

441
30:09.665 --> 30:10.585
When I was in the room,

442
30:11.465 --> 30:13.465
I told Old Madam Wei everything.

443
30:14.025 --> 30:16.945
To appease me, she asked what I wanted.

444
30:17.545 --> 30:18.865
So I asked her for this.

445
30:18.945 --> 30:22.625
This is what masters use to keep servants under their control.

446
30:24.185 --> 30:27.505
My Lady, are you really willing to give it to me?

447
30:41.345 --> 30:43.425
BITAO

448
30:51.745 --> 30:52.745
There.

449
30:53.465 --> 30:55.585
No one can control you with that contract anymore.

450
31:01.705 --> 31:02.625
Get up.

451
31:10.105 --> 31:11.705
SUBSTITUTION BRIDE, A DEFIED DECREE THE HANDKERCHIEF STANDS AS PROOF

452
31:13.865 --> 31:15.545
My Lady, you know how to read?

453
31:16.345 --> 31:18.065
People from all walks of life lived in our tenement.

454
31:19.025 --> 31:20.745
Literate storytellers,

455
31:21.345 --> 31:24.705
aging courtesans, concubines and illegitimate sons

456
31:25.225 --> 31:26.625
cast out after the master of the house died.

457
31:26.705 --> 31:28.465
I begged each one of them.

458
31:29.025 --> 31:30.985
Some kind souls would teach me a thing or two.

459
31:31.785 --> 31:34.065
With no pen or ink, I wrote with twigs in sand.

460
31:34.665 --> 31:36.785
After ten years, I learned to read most things.

461
31:37.865 --> 31:38.945
To keep anyone from finding out,

462
31:40.105 --> 31:42.625
I'd already practiced copying Lady Rao's handwriting.

463
31:43.225 --> 31:46.025
After all that, My Lady, you finally made it through.

464
31:47.385 --> 31:48.465
Silly girl.

465
31:51.825 --> 31:53.705
Even if Old Madam Wei lets me stay,

466
31:55.105 --> 31:58.465
Lady Wei Rao won't let this go.

467
31:59.665 --> 32:01.705
Lu Zhuo despises me,

468
32:01.785 --> 32:04.425
and the Lu family is a powerful clan with too many eyes and ears.

469
32:04.945 --> 32:09.065
One wrong move, and if anyone sees through me,

470
32:10.065 --> 32:11.425
I'll be the first to lose my head.

471
32:12.425 --> 32:13.745
Then what will you do, My Lady?

472
32:20.505 --> 32:21.785
No matter what,

473
32:24.505 --> 32:25.905
I have to secure my place

474
32:27.305 --> 32:28.745
in the Lu family.

475
32:43.225 --> 32:44.265
Madam.

476
32:50.905 --> 32:53.505
It seems you've won her trust.

477
32:54.345 --> 32:56.945
The fastest way to gain someone's trust

478
32:57.025 --> 32:59.585
is to share a secret that dare not see the light.

479
33:00.265 --> 33:02.145
It's a shame about Governess Wu.

480
33:02.865 --> 33:06.305
Why pity such a fool?

481
33:07.225 --> 33:09.745
You handled this very well.

482
33:10.505 --> 33:12.305
What should I do next?

483
33:12.945 --> 33:14.185
Please instruct me, Madam.

484
33:16.065 --> 33:20.665
Just stay by her side and do nothing.

485
33:21.865 --> 33:23.305
When I need you,

486
33:23.905 --> 33:25.825
I'll make the arrangements.

487
33:28.265 --> 33:29.385
No matter what,

488
33:30.105 --> 33:31.545
I'll help you.

489
33:45.585 --> 33:46.585
I've found out everything.

490
33:47.185 --> 33:49.985
The Dowager Lady has trouble chewing and loves golden osmanthus.

491
33:50.745 --> 33:53.945
These osmanthus cakes you made are sure to please her.

492
33:59.265 --> 34:00.585
Rao.

493
34:00.665 --> 34:01.705
Have you lost your mind too?

494
34:01.785 --> 34:03.785
Why bow to that vicious woman?

495
34:07.865 --> 34:09.065
What?

496
34:09.145 --> 34:11.264
Have you gone mad, Changning?

497
34:11.344 --> 34:12.905
How dare you insult me!

498
34:12.985 --> 34:15.985
A noble lady who won't even greet her elder sister-in-law,

499
34:16.505 --> 34:18.625
but calls her a vicious woman to her face?

500
34:19.824 --> 34:22.145
Either you've suddenly gone mad, or no one ever taught you manners.

501
34:23.065 --> 34:24.744
Changhui seems perfectly well-mannered.

502
34:25.264 --> 34:26.865
So the problem must be you.

503
34:27.465 --> 34:28.865
You vicious witch!

504
34:28.945 --> 34:32.065
Pretty on the outside, but rotten to the core!

505
34:32.145 --> 34:34.105
You were jealous of Hualou's beauty and talent,

506
34:34.185 --> 34:36.545
so you shoved her down, and nearly killed her!

507
34:37.625 --> 34:41.385
Keep shouting, and I'll tell Grandmother and Aunt.

508
34:41.985 --> 34:44.744
Then let's see how you survive in the Lu family.

509
34:45.465 --> 34:47.304
Sister, please stop.

510
34:48.304 --> 34:50.344
Why would I push her for no reason?

511
34:50.425 --> 34:53.344
Wasn't it because Hualou had feelings for our cousin?

512
34:53.425 --> 34:55.705
-Shh… -So you got jealous and tried to kill her!

513
34:56.945 --> 35:00.305
So Lady Xie has feelings for my husband.

514
35:00.385 --> 35:01.625
Wei Rao!

515
35:02.905 --> 35:03.785
-My Lady! -Rao!

516
35:03.865 --> 35:05.145
-Wei Rao! Let go! -Rao!

517
35:05.225 --> 35:06.305
Wei Rao, let go!

518
35:12.665 --> 35:13.745
Wei Rao!

519
35:17.225 --> 35:18.265
Watch out!

520
35:26.225 --> 35:27.145
Lu Changning.

521
35:28.145 --> 35:29.225
Your behavior is disgraceful.

522
35:29.305 --> 35:30.865
Go copy the family rules 100 times!

523
35:31.465 --> 35:32.745
Brother!

524
35:32.825 --> 35:34.385
You're still defending that vicious woman?

525
35:34.465 --> 35:35.945
She clearly tried to hurt Hualou!

526
35:36.025 --> 35:38.545
I'm punishing you for your disrespect and forgetting your place.

527
35:39.185 --> 35:40.425
Go kneel in the ancestral hall for two more hours.

528
35:40.505 --> 35:41.745
Brother!

529
35:41.825 --> 35:44.705
Anyone who dares plead for her can kneel with her!

530
35:46.945 --> 35:49.545
You vicious fraud!

531
35:50.185 --> 35:51.385
Sooner or later, I'll expose you for what you are!

532
36:02.065 --> 36:03.305
What are you looking for?

533
36:04.585 --> 36:06.625
-Your fox tail. -Shunqin.

534
36:07.745 --> 36:09.505
Enough with the fooling around.

535
36:10.025 --> 36:11.305
Weren't we here to talk business?

536
36:11.825 --> 36:13.025
Come over here now.

537
36:15.025 --> 36:16.505
We're all family here. No need to send the ladies away.

538
36:17.025 --> 36:17.945
Sister-in-law, join us.

539
36:33.025 --> 36:34.105
These are all for me?

540
36:34.185 --> 36:36.025
Everything you picked at the shop yesterday.

541
36:36.545 --> 36:37.905
I had them delivered.

542
36:38.785 --> 36:39.625
Thank you, My Lord.

543
36:41.785 --> 36:44.505
And thank you, General Qi, for bringing them yourself.

544
36:59.305 --> 37:00.425
Everything's arranged?

545
37:01.225 --> 37:02.265
Don't worry.

546
37:02.945 --> 37:06.705
I recovered so quickly thanks to Rao's devoted care.

547
37:08.665 --> 37:10.185
The Qixi Festival is in two days.

548
37:10.265 --> 37:11.665
The streets will be lively.

549
37:12.785 --> 37:13.745
I'll take you out.

550
37:18.025 --> 37:19.945
Grandmother ordered it. I can't disobey.

551
37:21.065 --> 37:22.385
You should get ready too.

552
37:23.225 --> 37:25.425
I'm glad you care, My Lord.

553
37:32.945 --> 37:34.825
They should die! All of them!

554
37:40.945 --> 37:41.945
Rao!

555
37:43.145 --> 37:44.305
Rao!

556
37:44.385 --> 37:45.545
Let me see.

557
37:45.625 --> 37:46.665
Did you hurt yourself?

558
37:46.745 --> 37:49.185
Aunt Heng'e, you have to help me.

559
37:50.385 --> 37:53.065
You want me to get you out?

560
37:53.625 --> 37:54.905
What are you planning?

561
37:56.385 --> 37:58.025
Grandmother thinks if she keeps me locked up,

562
37:58.105 --> 37:59.625
there's nothing I can do?

563
38:00.265 --> 38:06.025
Unless that wretch hides in the Duke's Residence forever,

564
38:06.785 --> 38:08.105
the moment she steps out,

565
38:10.025 --> 38:14.945
I'll send her right back where she came from!

566
38:20.025 --> 38:23.065
SEVENTH DAY OF THE SEVENTH MONTH

567
38:35.145 --> 38:36.585
Doesn't this puppet look like Lu Zhuo?

568
38:36.665 --> 38:37.505
Looks like you.

569
38:42.625 --> 38:43.505
I know this area well.

570
38:44.025 --> 38:47.185
See? That fire performer isn't even a tenth as good as me.

571
38:51.865 --> 38:53.145
There's a shop ahead with delicious festival pastries.

572
38:53.225 --> 38:54.385
QIXI FESTIVAL PASTRY

573
38:54.465 --> 38:55.665
Miss, take a look. Which ones would you like?

574
38:55.745 --> 38:57.265
I'll wrap them up for you.

575
38:57.345 --> 38:58.185
They look so fresh.

576
38:58.265 --> 39:00.025
They were all made today.

577
39:00.105 --> 39:01.905
This one and this one.

578
39:01.985 --> 39:02.825
Of course.

579
39:05.145 --> 39:06.305
Here you are, Miss.

580
39:06.825 --> 39:07.985
Tonight, let me wish you good fortune.

581
39:08.625 --> 39:11.465
May these festival pastries bless you with even greater wit and skill.

582
39:13.065 --> 39:13.945
Thank you, General Qi.

583
39:16.025 --> 39:17.545
What are you dawdling for?

584
39:17.625 --> 39:18.785
Aren't you going to toss the fortune needle?

585
39:19.545 --> 39:20.705
It's just ahead.

586
39:23.425 --> 39:25.105
Zhuo, don't you have something important to do?

587
39:25.185 --> 39:26.265
Go take care of it.

588
39:30.985 --> 39:32.025
Keep an eye on her.

589
39:40.545 --> 39:41.545
Come take a look.

590
39:42.065 --> 39:43.345
Fresh festival pastries.

591
39:43.865 --> 39:45.625
-Come take a look. -You're not Wei Rao at all.

592
39:52.705 --> 39:54.545
Lu Zhuo went to war at 13.

593
39:54.625 --> 39:56.385
What would he know about telling women apart?

594
39:57.265 --> 39:59.785
But I grew up with 15 or 16 female cousins.

595
40:00.425 --> 40:02.505
I can spot your flaws easily.

596
40:09.185 --> 40:10.025
I'm listening.

597
40:10.865 --> 40:12.545
A pampered beauty like her has snow-white skin.

598
40:12.625 --> 40:13.745
But you…

599
40:15.425 --> 40:17.745
Your eyes may be beautiful, but your complexion gives you away.

600
40:18.385 --> 40:20.305
The real Wei Rao has arched brows and piercing eyes,

601
40:20.385 --> 40:21.705
the look of someone proud and headstrong.

602
40:22.385 --> 40:24.425
Your eyes are lively and sharp,

603
40:24.505 --> 40:25.745
the look of someone clever and cunning.

604
40:26.465 --> 40:28.665
The real Wei Rao moves with delicate grace.

605
40:28.745 --> 40:30.385
But your steps are firm and steady.

606
40:31.625 --> 40:33.665
You're clearly not the same person.

607
41:05.025 --> 41:07.585
Then look at my hand. How is it different from hers?

608
41:12.385 --> 41:13.225
What are you doing?

609
41:13.305 --> 41:16.825
My husband considers you a trusted comrade, a sworn brother.

610
41:16.905 --> 41:18.985
Yet while he's away, you dare speak so rudely to his wife!

611
41:19.585 --> 41:21.465
You're not the only one who can read faces.

612
41:21.985 --> 41:23.345
I can too!

613
41:24.905 --> 41:26.905
Your eyes are deep-set and hollow, your brows slant and your eyes leer.

614
41:26.985 --> 41:28.865
You have the hungry stare of a lecher!

615
41:29.585 --> 41:31.985
So you're a shameless scoundrel,

616
41:32.065 --> 41:34.425
two-faced and treacherous, trading honor for a woman's favor.

617
41:34.505 --> 41:35.345
How lecherous!

618
41:35.425 --> 41:37.585
How dare you stare at your sister-in-law's figure?

619
41:37.665 --> 41:38.825
Have you no shame?

620
41:38.905 --> 41:40.465
You even dare flirt with your sister-in-law?

621
41:40.545 --> 41:41.625
Absolutely shameless!

622
41:41.705 --> 41:44.865
Nonsense! I'm this handsome. How are my brows and eyes crooked?

623
41:44.945 --> 41:45.825
You…

624
41:46.865 --> 41:48.985
Help! Someone's been killed on East Street!

625
41:49.065 --> 41:50.785
Murder! Call the authorities!

626
41:51.305 --> 41:52.625
Just as expected.

627
41:53.305 --> 41:55.185
Lord Lu is injured. I need to help him.

628
41:55.705 --> 41:56.825
Protect Lady Lu.

629
42:52.345 --> 42:53.545
Retreat! Hurry!

630
42:58.905 --> 42:59.905
I've waited long enough for you.

631
42:59.985 --> 43:01.425
Where do you think you're going?

632
43:06.585 --> 43:07.785
Where is she?

633
43:07.865 --> 43:09.105
Didn't I tell you to watch her?

634
43:12.665 --> 43:13.745
Search over there.

635
43:21.905 --> 43:23.305
My Lady, they're gone.

636
43:30.545 --> 43:32.985
Qi Zhongkai is trouble too.

637
43:33.625 --> 43:36.945
I'll have to be even more careful when dealing with him.

638
43:37.025 --> 43:38.745
Come take a look!

639
43:39.265 --> 43:40.905
Beautiful floating lanterns!

640
43:40.985 --> 43:41.905
My Lady, look.

641
43:41.985 --> 43:43.825
People are making wishes with lanterns over there.

642
43:43.905 --> 43:46.625
-Come take a look! -What a lively scene.

643
43:46.705 --> 43:48.825
Floating lanterns! Come see!

644
43:49.425 --> 43:51.345
-Bravo! -Bravo!

645
43:51.425 --> 43:52.385
He's spitting fire!

646
43:52.465 --> 43:53.305
One more!

647
43:53.385 --> 43:55.305
-Bravo! -Bravo!

648
43:55.385 --> 43:57.745
-Bravo! -Bravo!

649
43:58.265 --> 44:00.025
Nothing for me here.

650
44:00.865 --> 44:01.985
Sure!

651
44:09.025 --> 44:13.225
Heaven above, please keep Mother and Hongxian safe.

652
44:13.305 --> 44:14.705
Move! Get out of my way!

653
44:15.225 --> 44:16.425
-Move! -Hurry!

654
44:16.505 --> 44:18.505
-My Lady! -Everyone down there, get out!

655
44:19.145 --> 44:20.105
Who is that?

656
44:20.185 --> 44:21.265
Move!

657
44:25.225 --> 44:26.065
Get out!

658
44:26.705 --> 44:27.865
Move, now!

659
44:29.785 --> 44:31.945
Lady Rao! Lady Rao!

660
44:32.025 --> 44:33.025
-You can't do this! -How dare you betray me!

661
44:33.105 --> 44:33.985
Bitao!

662
44:37.625 --> 44:39.505
Grab that wretched woman!

663
44:52.585 --> 44:54.625
Aren't you so clever?

664
44:54.705 --> 44:56.145
Don't you always have a trick up your sleeve?

665
44:56.745 --> 44:57.905
You even fooled Grandmother into believing you

666
44:57.985 --> 44:59.465
and locking me inside.

667
44:59.545 --> 45:00.585
You thought you could replace me

668
45:00.665 --> 45:02.665
and become the daughter-in-law of the Duke's Residence?

669
45:02.745 --> 45:04.065
Dream on!

670
45:05.505 --> 45:08.145
If Lu Zhuo learns the wife he married

671
45:08.225 --> 45:11.265
is nothing but a filthy, lowborn chamber-pot woman,

672
45:11.345 --> 45:12.625
he'll be sick to death!

673
45:13.305 --> 45:16.905
You fraud, stealing another woman's place! Heaven made you lowborn.

674
45:16.985 --> 45:20.305
You should've known your place and stayed in the gutter your whole life!

675
45:20.385 --> 45:22.945
You tried to steal a life that was never yours.

676
45:23.025 --> 45:24.745
This is what you get!

677
45:25.265 --> 45:27.545
Die! Just die!

678
45:44.625 --> 45:45.505
She's not breathing.

679
46:51.105 --> 46:52.305
Look! What's happening over there?

680
46:52.385 --> 46:53.785
What happened?

681
46:53.865 --> 46:55.185
Did someone fall into the water?

682
46:56.225 --> 46:57.185
Lady Rao!

683
46:57.745 --> 46:58.865
Hurry! Hurry!

684
46:58.945 --> 46:59.785
Quick!

685
47:03.105 --> 47:04.305
-Over there! -Hurry up!

686
47:04.385 --> 47:05.785
Hurry!

687
47:05.865 --> 47:06.865
Someone save her!

688
47:06.945 --> 47:08.265
You're noble! You're so important!

689
47:08.865 --> 47:10.345
Heaven gave you so much,

690
47:10.425 --> 47:11.785
yet you threw it all away!

691
47:11.865 --> 47:13.265
Now you want it back?

692
47:13.345 --> 47:14.945
You don't get to have it both ways!

693
47:15.025 --> 47:15.945
Want to see who wins?

694
47:16.025 --> 47:18.825
Me, who grew up fighting through the gutter,

695
47:18.905 --> 47:20.785
or you, who grew up surrounded by luxury?

696
47:20.865 --> 47:22.385
Let's see which of us is harder to kill!

697
47:36.225 --> 47:39.145
Help! Somebody help!

698
47:39.225 --> 47:40.425
-My Lady! -By the river!

699
47:40.505 --> 47:41.425
-My Lord! -Somebody help!

700
47:41.505 --> 47:42.545
-My Lord! -Murder!

701
47:43.745 --> 47:47.065
My Lord! Help! My Lord!

702
47:47.585 --> 47:48.625
My Lady!

703
47:50.825 --> 47:51.785
Don't say a word.

704
47:51.865 --> 47:54.105
If he finds out, we're both dead.

705
48:03.705 --> 48:05.265
-Over there. -Be careful!

706
48:05.865 --> 48:06.905
Come on! Catch that!

707
48:08.465 --> 48:10.465
Here! Can you reach it?

708
48:12.065 --> 48:13.545
Grab on!

709
48:15.585 --> 48:16.625
Careful.

710
48:17.425 --> 48:18.505
Come on!

711
48:19.505 --> 48:20.545
My Lady.

712
48:22.705 --> 48:23.985
What happened?

713
48:25.905 --> 48:28.025
M-My Lady was here releasing a lantern and praying

714
48:28.105 --> 48:29.265
when she was attacked by robbers.

715
48:29.345 --> 48:30.705
They weren't satisfied with stealing her valuables.

716
48:30.785 --> 48:31.905
They tried to abduct My Lady too.

717
48:31.985 --> 48:34.545
But when they heard you were coming, they got scared and fled.

718
48:34.625 --> 48:37.065
Have the city guards search the entire city. Let's get back first.

719
48:37.865 --> 48:39.865
You're still injured. Let me.

720
48:40.785 --> 48:42.065
Clear the way!

721
48:51.505 --> 48:52.745
Make way! Make way!

722
51:10.865 --> 51:13.465
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
